    "name": {
      "value": "Martial Disciple"
    },
    "source": {
      "value": "pc1"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "You dedicated yourself to intense training and rigorous study to become a great warrior. The school you attended might have been a traditionalist monastery, an elite military academy, or the local branch of a prestigious mercenary organization.\n\nChoose two attribute boosts. One must be to Strength or Dexterity, and one is a free attribute boost.\n\nYou're trained in your choice of the Acrobatics or Athletics skill. You gain a skill feat: Cat Fall if you chose Acrobatics or Quick Jump if you chose Athletics. You're also trained in the Warfare Lore skill."
    },
